Herdr Git Workspace
===================

Copyright 2026 李楠 (kidoln)

A set of mods for Herdr (https://herdr.dev), plus one window layout
(layouts/herdr-git.json).

Mods written for this project:

    mods/git
    mods/git-diff
    mods/file-view

Mods adapted from mods shipped with Herdr, licensed under the Apache
License, Version 2.0:

    mods/agents-left    - adapted from Herdr's "agents" mod
    mods/files-menu     - adapted from Herdr's "files" mod
    mods/status-branch  - adapted from Herdr's "workspace-status" mod
    mods/tabs-git       - adapted from Herdr's "tabs" mod
